      "text_utf8": "The exact prescribed Ox route is externally blocked: after a forced online refresh, `opencode-go/ox-alpha-free` remains delisted, and there is no true alias or verified free Go replacement.\n\nRecommended authority change: replace both Ox/max rows with `opencode-zen/mimo-v2.5-free` at `high`, preceded by one fresh zero-credit native-Goal canary. This changes provider/model/effort but preserves a free weak-model-first gate and the 24-row denominator.\n\nAlternatives are `opencode-zen/hy3-free|xhigh`, or removing Ox and reducing the matrix to 22 rows.\n\nDo you authorize the recommended MiMo replacement? The Goal remains active; all failed Ox attempts remain permanent zero-credit failures.",
